      <groundspeak:logs>
        <groundspeak:log id="684560146">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-07T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="3339080">Gimli*/GeoJoce</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP338 Hawrelak Park North&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Walked here from South and this one was, thankfully, much quicker.  I was very close to the muggle population in the park here so managing an 'in and out' was perfect.  Most likely thanks to previous finders.  I studied the context pics before getting here but the hole was nice and defined.  :)  I was headed to Emily Murphy next for a few more.  TFTBC and for bringing me to the area today.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="683768878">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-04T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="7458582">mkPerry</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP338 Hawrelak Park North

Quick stop on the way home. Since it was starting to get dark there weren't that many muggles about. Find was extremely easy with a red flag planted next to it. 

Thanks outforthehunt for another BCP. &lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="683670724">
