          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="9859564">Hallzey</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP338 Hawrelak Park North&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Second brass cap, with two so close together we couldn't help but grab both of them, a nice quick find it's got a flag on it looks like they might be doing some work in the area soon.&lt;/p&gt;

